      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": " 古歌：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "An old poem says:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01266",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "“杨桐之叶发幽香，我今特地来寻芳。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The leaves of the cleyera give off a hidden fragrance, and I have come here especially to seek that scent.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01266",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "但见神女缥缈姿，共奏神乐聚一堂。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "There I see only the faint, graceful forms of divine maidens, gathered in one hall to play sacred music together.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01266",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "见《拾遗集》。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "This appears in the Shuishu collection.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
